{"id":"53312","nombre":"Ensalada ácida de repollo","original":"Tangy cabbage slaw","categoria":"Vegetarian","origen":"Ucrania","imagen":"https://www.themealdb.com/images/media/meals/e2g2r21764367568.jpg","video":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oVuAky9HTlM","enlace":"https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/tangy-cabbage-slaw","etiquetas":[],"ingredientes":[["Mayonesa","250 ml","Mayonnaise"],["Limón","Ralladura y jugo de 1","Lemon"],["Vinagre de manzana","2 cdas","Cider Vinegar"],["Mostaza en grano","2 cdas","Wholegrain Mustard"],["Sal de apio","1 cdta","Celery Salt"],["Repollo blanco","1/4","White Cabbage"],["Repollo colorado","1/4","Red Cabbage"],["Zanahorias","2","Carrots"],["Cebolla","1 en cubitos","Onion"],["Apio","2 en rodajas","Celery"]],"pasos":["Batir en un bol chico la mayonesa, la ralladura y el jugo de limón, el vinagre, la mostaza y la sal de apio, y salpimentar generosamente.","Agregar el repollo, las zanahorias, la cebolla y el apio. Mezclar bien y llevar a la heladera. Se puede preparar hasta 1 día antes."]}